* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf

# Unified/email patches require a one-space context line and `-- ` signature.
# Preserve their checksum-locked bytes without reporting patch-format syntax as
# whitespace damage. Repo's resolved manifest similarly emits indentation-only
# blank lines and is compared byte-for-byte by the source-lock verifier.
*.patch text eol=lf -whitespace
manifests/resolved.xml text eol=lf -whitespace

